        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>银行结算业务笔记</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']] },\n      svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      background: #fff;\n      color: #222;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"宋体\", serif;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 755px;\n      padding: 12px 18px 20px;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      line-height: 1.42;\n    }\n\n    .document {\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .section {\n      margin: 0 0 17px;\n    }\n\n    .heading {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      margin: 0 0 5px;\n    }\n\n    .line {\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      min-height: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .red {\n      color: #9f4a4a;\n    }\n\n    .blue {\n      color: #4f8b91;\n    }\n\n    .underline {\n      text-decoration: underline;\n      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n      text-underline-offset: 1px;\n    }\n\n    .indent {\n      padding-left: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .large-gap {\n      margin-top: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .subsection {\n      margin-top: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .table-like {\n      margin-top: 3px;\n    }\n\n    .two-col {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      column-gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .note {\n      margin-top: 5px;\n    }\n\n    .bottom {\n      margin-top: 15px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"document\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"heading\">第一节　支付结算概述</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">不使用现金</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">支票 汇票 本票 银行卡 网络支付（<span class=\"red\">无服务费</span>）</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">货币信用</span>　能的快捷性的保证 但<span class=\"red\">不支付</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\">收款人名称　不能变更</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">出票日期　大写</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">金额　大写　阿拉伯记载　必须一致</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">日期的大写　①10、20、30　月 1-2、10　②如章日 11-19　月 10-12</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">金额 日期 收款人名称 不得更改</span>→<span class=\"red\">更改无效</span>→<span class=\"red\">重新填</span>　其他内容记载人可更改（更改处签章）</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">伪造→签章　变造→更改资料以外</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"heading\">第二节　银行结算账户</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">单位/个人银行结算账户</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">单位：基本 一般 专用户 临时</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">企业：备案制（无需核发开户许可证）签订结算账户管理协议（<span class=\"red\">法人签</span>）与法人或负责人核实开户意愿</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent\"><span class=\"red\">开立之日起即可办理付款业务</span>　（其他单位?3日后）</div>\n      <div class=\"line underline\">存款人的名称—5日内备案　其他变更—5日内通知　开立或撤销一般结算账户后10日内向银行开立（工作日）</div>\n\n      <div class=\"subsection\">\n        <div class=\"line\">撤销账户→最后撤销→“基本存款账户”</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">不得撤销→存款人尚未清偿债务</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">应撤未撤　30日未撤行政撤销</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"subsection\">\n        <div class=\"line\">基本账户：能存能取（工资等活动）　主办账户　1单位1个</div>\n        <div class=\"line indent\">谁能开→　<span class=\"red\">异地常设　单位</span>（单位内部?部门）　企业法人　非法人企业　合伙企业　个体户</div>\n        <div class=\"line indent\">机关事业单位　行业协会（可以开户）以及村民委员会等</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"table-like\">\n        <div class=\"line\">一般账户：能存不能取　贷款借款转存、归还　其他结算　开户无需复核则（基本户以外的）</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">专用账户：能存不能取　证券交易结算资金专户　清缴安全保费　收入汇缴能存不能取　<span class=\"red\">收入汇缴账户不能存</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\">临时账户：能存能取　不超过2年　<span class=\"red\">异地临时</span>　注册资金（能存不能取）增资</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">零余额账户：能取不能存　财政授权支付→转账、取现　1单位1个　<span class=\"red\">基本户/专用户管理</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">判定→工资总额、住房公积金、提取利息（不得向本单位其他账户和上级下级单位划拨资金）</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\">个人结算账户：公转私每年超过5万提供付款依据或者非实名</div>\n        <div class=\"line indent\">见1类/信用卡可开2类3类　1类能存能取　2类能存能取（限额）　3类只能存不能取</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"subsection\">\n        <div class=\"line\">法律责任：单位登记虚假存入　1000元</div>\n        <div class=\"line indent\">经营性存款人　变更登记　1000元</div>\n        <div class=\"line indent\">伪造变造遗失开户　开立、撤销违规　1-3万</div>\n        <div class=\"line indent\">使用违规　0.5-3万</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section bottom\">\n      <div class=\"heading\">第三节　银行非现金支付业务</div>\n      <div class=\"line blue\">当事人</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">基本当事人：支付时→出票人　付款人　收款人</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">非基本当事人：交付后→承兑人　背书人　被背书人　保证人</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">相对记载事项：出票地　付款地　商业汇票付款日期　背书日期　保证日期　承兑日期</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">在记载事项：印记无效（无记载无效（不得补记）</div>\n\n      <div class=\"subsection\">\n        <div class=\"line blue\">票据行为（出票 背书 承兑 保证）</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">出票　真实的委托付款关系　可撤销全额　不得接受无对付的票据</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">背书　①禁止背书　②非转让背书（委托收款 背书付）</div>\n        <div class=\"line indent\">背书人在汇票被背书人名称的　被背书人可自行记载　由同等法律效力</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
